  "description": "## **Inventory Full** 🎒  \n*Because loot comes first.*\n\nWe’re a **fun, casual, but active guild** recruiting players who actually show up and contribute.  \nNo stress, no drama — just steady progress and full inventories.\n\n### **Requirements**\n- ⚔️ **Combat Level 40+**\n- ✅ Active players (don’t be a ghost)\n- 🤝 Willing to contribute to the guild\n\n### **What we do**\n- 🗡️ **Daily raids**\n- 🏆 **Guild challenges** (everyone helps 👍)\n- 📈 Grow stronger together and share the rewards\n\n### **Questions?**\nIf you have any questions, just message **J3ff** or **Beule94**.\n\n### **Our vibe**\n- Play at your own pace  \n- Stay active and help out  \n- Progress together, profit together\n\nIf your **inventory is always full** and your **timers never stop**,  \nyou’ll fit right in.\n\n**Join Inventory Full** — 🎒 loot first, questions later.",
